Z||000000||MinnGreenGT||09-25-2001||04:16 PM||||OK, this has been floating back and forth on another thread as a side topic...so let's finalize something!<P>Anyone in/around the Minnesota area- we're going to have a meet/cruise night on this Saturday September 29th @ 7pm.  Let's plan on meeting in the empty lot directly north of the Mall of America.  Everyone is welcome to come whoever can make it (that means the people just across the border in WI too).  We'll probably hang out and check everybody's cars out for awhile, then go north to University Avenue in St.Paul to invade Porkey's on the strip (or Arby's  ...whatever).  <P>*Maybe we need to take a side trip through the lot behind White Castle off of University too... it's where the import racers hang out  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Everyone post your thoughts!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg">     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fullstaff.gif">   <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
