Z||000006||MinnGreenGT||09-26-2001||09:30 AM||||I don't hang out at the mall, so I'm not totally sure about which stores- let's see:  Nordstrom is the northwest corner, sears is the northeast corner.  Landau Street & Kilabrew Drive are the streets running east/west by the mall. Landau is on the north side of the mall, so get off on Landau.  If you're coming off Cedear/77 (doesn't matter direction) you'll be headed east on Landau.  The Turn LEFT at the first stoplight/intersection- you'll be in the spare north lot.<P>For those that might know the area pre-MOA, the lot is where the MET center used to be.<P>Does that clarify?||||reg||1
