Z||000028||Standard||09-27-2001||11:01 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Jimmy:<BR><B>I'm not trying to steal away from this gathering  but if anyone wants to have a little fun Friday night LMK.  Jaei Sun I'm sure I can count on you, Standard did you fix your car(mounts cv boot)?  <P>Jim<BR>87 GT T-TOP V8<BR>87 GT</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well, the front tranny mount is fine, I jury-rigged the rear with a hose clamp to keep it from moving around too much, seems to be holding up so far.  Gotta tie down the cv boot again, damn zip-ties keep breaking  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Too lazy to pull it out again and put on the replacement clamp I have.  But I have some 19 gauge steel wire I'm gonna tie it down with, should hold up much better.  Just gotta get around to cleaning up all the grease that's there.  <P>I gotta do that tomorrow and change the oil, but I should be free in the evening.  Let me know what time you wanna get together.  <P>BTW Jimmy, my brother was just telling me that one of his friends that was at Red Rock was telling him about "this red Fiero that was kicking everyone's a$$".  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
